    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/7c5cdbb7a5baf40fff3af80a42dd3d41.poster.avif?t=1720430614\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/7c5cdbb7a5baf40fff3af80a42dd3d41.webm?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/7c5cdbb7a5baf40fff3af80a42dd3d41.mp4?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/005484cae1ce97d4063eeaef6dc86799.webp?t=1720430614\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A modern take on Speedball; take some Rocket League, add a little World of Tanks, sprinkle some Tony Hawk's Pro Skater skills, stunts and combos and you have Combat League!<br></li><li> 3v3 Team combat military arcade action \u2013 win games by accumulating more points than the opposition. <br></li><li> Combat League is all about points. Receive points for stunts, skills, goals, assists, saves and eliminations.<br></li><li> Beginners might settle for just scoring a goal, but as you gain experience you'll chain jumps, donuts, eliminations, airtime and, of course, goals for the ultimate combo score.<br></li><li> Featuring Online PvP, Splitscreen and Single-Player Season modes.</li></ul><br><strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/ebba6d36419443aa7361ef77efee43b9.poster.avif?t=1720430614\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/ebba6d36419443aa7361ef77efee43b9.webm?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/ebba6d36419443aa7361ef77efee43b9.mp4?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VISIT THE WORKSHOP</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/005484cae1ce97d4063eeaef6dc86799.webp?t=1720430614\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Vehicles - Featuring a range of Tanks, APCs, SUVs and more to keep you going in the mix of the action.<br></li><li> Weapons - Looking for a sniper missile? Or perhaps the bouncing betty? Maybe just keep it simple with the standard load-out. Your call!<br></li><li> Aerials - No Vehicle is complete without a ridiculous aerial! A Banana? Traffic cone? Hat? Even an Airplane is available to select in Combat League.<br></li><li> Patches - Pick from a range of unique Patches to help you make your mark and really stand out from the crowd.<br></li><li> Try out various weapons, vehicles, aerials and patches to see which ones best match your play and style.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>STADIUMS</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/005484cae1ce97d4063eeaef6dc86799.webp?t=1720430614\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Travel around the world in Season mode or unleash your fury on a random stadium, there's a wide variety of different locations to master:<br></li><li> Head out to the Coal Shed in Victoria, Australia and get ready for a dust-up.<br></li><li> Sweat it out on a volcanic Hawaiian escape in Ember\u2019s Trail.<br></li><li> Brave the eerie nights of the Horror Pit in Transylvania, Romania.<br></li><li> Visit the city streets of Tarlac, Philippines and prepare to clean up the opposition.<br></li><li> Search through the snow of the Canadian falls in Blizzard Peak.<br></li><li> All these and more await your combat!</li></ul><br><strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.poster.avif?t=1720430614\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.webm?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.mp4?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></strong></strong></strong>",
