</li><li> All these and more await your combat!</li></ul><br><strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.poster.avif?t=1720430614\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.webm?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1397500/extras/f4c321000eb94a7b98f967d1a5b4256a.mp4?t=1720430614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></strong></strong></strong>",
